<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>心理成就博物馆|剧情阅读版</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0a0a0a;
            --card-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            --card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            --text-main: #e0e0e0;
            --text-sub: #a0a0a0;
            --accent-red: #ff4d4d;
            --accent-blue: #4da6ff;
            --accent-purple: #b34dff;
            --accent-gold: #ffd700;
            --accent-green: #4dff88;
            --accent-grey: #888888;
            --accent-cyan: #00e5ff; /* 角色类型颜色 */
            --reading-bg: #111;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding-bottom: 4rem;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* --- 博物馆界面样式 --- */
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 4rem 0 2rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, #fff, #888);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-sub);
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .filters {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .filter-btn {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            color: var(--text-sub);
            padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .filter-btn:hover, .filter-btn.active {
            border-color: var(--accent-red);
            color: var(--accent-red);
            background: rgba(255, 77, 77, 0.05);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 77, 77, 0.1);
        }

        .achievement-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1400px;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        .achievement-card {
            position: relative;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 2rem;
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            min-height: 200px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .achievement-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 4px;
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--card-border);
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }

        .achievement-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .achievement-card:hover::before {
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px currentColor;
        }

        /* 类型颜色 */
        .type-story { color: var(--accent-red); }
        .type-story::before { background: var(--accent-red); }
        .type-status { color: var(--accent-blue); }
        .type-status::before { background: var(--accent-blue); }
        .type-philosophy { color: var(--accent-purple); }
        .type-philosophy::before { background: var(--accent-purple); }
        .type-ending { color: var(--accent-gold); }
        .type-ending::before { background: var(--accent-gold); }
        .type-secret { color: var(--accent-green); }
        .type-secret::before { background: var(--accent-green); }
        .type-role { color: var(--accent-cyan); }
        .type-role::before { background: var(--accent-cyan); }
        .type-default { color: var(--text-sub); }

        .card-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .achievement-tag {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .achievement-name {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .achievement-desc {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-sub);
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-weight: 300;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        /* 隐藏成就 */
        .card-hidden .achievement-name,
        .card-hidden .achievement-desc {
            filter: blur(6px);
            user-select: none;
            transition: filter 0.3s ease;
        }
        .card-hidden:hover .achievement-name,
        .card-hidden:hover .achievement-desc {
            filter: blur(0);
        }
        .hidden-icon {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--text-sub);
            opacity: 0.2;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        .achievement-card {
            animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease-out backwards;
        }

        /* --- 剧情阅读器样式 (覆盖层) --- */
        .reader-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
            z-index: 3000;
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            transition: opacity 0.5s ease;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .reader-overlay.active {
            opacity: 1;
            pointer-events: auto;
        }

        /* 暗角效果 */
        .reader-overlay::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, transparent 50%, black 150%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .reader-content {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 800px;
            background: var(--reading-bg);
            border: 1px solid #333;
            box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 4rem 3rem;
            position: relative;
            transform: translateY(20px);
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
            max-height: 80vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
            /* 隐藏滚动条但保留功能 */
            scrollbar-width: none;
            -ms-overflow-style: none;
        }
        .reader-content::-webkit-scrollbar {
            display: none;
        }

        .reader-overlay.active .reader-content {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .close-reader {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 2rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: color 0.3s;
            z-index: 10;
        }
        .close-reader:hover { color: #fff; }

        .reader-title {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .reader-text {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            line-height: 2;
            color: #dcdcdc;
            text-align: justify;
            min-height: 200px;
        }

        /* 光标闪烁 */
        .cursor {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 2px;
            height: 1.2em;
            background-color: var(--accent-gold);
            animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
            vertical-align: text-bottom;
        }

        @keyframes blink {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0; }
        }

        /* 底部奖励栏 */
        .reader-footer {
            margin-top: 3rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #333;
            padding-top: 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(20px);
            transition: all 0.5s ease;
        }

        .reader-footer.show {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .reward-display {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.05);
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .reward-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; }
        .reward-text { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--accent-gold); font-weight: bold; }

        .claim-btn {
            padding: 10px 30px;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--accent-gold), #ffa500);
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            color: #000;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2);
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        }
        .claim-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4);
        }
        .claim-btn:disabled {
            background: #333;
            color: #666;
            cursor: not-allowed;
            box-shadow: none;
            transform: none;
        }

        /* 响应式 */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .title { font-size: 2.5rem; }
            .achievement-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .reader-content { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; width: 95%; }
            .reader-title { font-size: 1.8rem; }
            .reader-text { font-size: 1.1rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="header">
        <h1 class="title">心理成就博物馆</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">Museum of Psychological Achievements</div>
    </div>

    <!-- 筛选器 -->
    <div class="filters" id="filters">
        <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all">全部</button>
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="story">剧情</button>
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="status">心理状态</button>
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="philosophy">哲学</button>
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="ending">结局</button>
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="secret">隐藏</button>
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="role">角色</button>
    </div>

    <div class="achievement-container" id="achievements"></div>

    <!-- 剧情阅读器覆盖层 -->
    <div class="reader-overlay" id="readerOverlay">
        <button class="close-reader" onclick="closeReader()">×</button>
        <div class="reader-content">
            <div class="reader-title" id="r-title">标题</div>
            <div class="reader-text" id="r-text"></div>

            <div class="reader-footer" id="r-footer">
                <div class="reward-display">
                    <span class="reward-icon">💎</span>
                    <span class="reward-text" id="r-reward">奖励内容</span>
                </div>
                <button class="claim-btn" id="r-claimBtn" onclick="claimReward()">领取奖励</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // 完整的成就数据 (包含所有原有及新增条目)
        const achievementsData = [
            // --- 原有数据 (部分示例) ---
            { "id": "jieu_yu", "name": "解语", "description": "你读懂了所有人的心事，却没人看懂你眼底的荒芜。", "type": "story", "hidden": false, "story": "你读懂了所有人的心事，却没人看懂你眼底的荒芜。\n\n在这漫长的旅途中，你选择沉默，将万千情绪化作一声叹息。你看着他们欢笑、哭泣、争吵、拥抱，像是在看一场没有剧本的默剧。你试图伸出援手，却发现你的手穿过了他们的身体——你只是一个观察者，一个被遗忘的幽灵。", "reward": "获得称号：[ 心灵捕手 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "gui_chen", "name": "归尘", "description": "你送了无数人归土，自己却连尘埃都不愿收留。", "type": "story", "hidden": false, "story": "你送了无数人归土，自己却连尘埃都不愿收留。\n\n风沙掩埋了过往，你依旧孑然一身，向着未知的远方前行。你记得每一个人的名字，记得他们临终前的嘱托，但你无法停下。你的脚步声在空旷的荒原上回响，那是你唯一的伴奏。", "reward": "获得道具：[ 旅行斗篷 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "zhi_san", "name": "执伞", "description": "你为众生遮风挡雨，雨停时，只剩你一人站在暴雨里。", "type": "story", "hidden": false, "story": "你为众生遮风挡雨，雨停时，只剩你一人站在暴雨里。\n\n伞下空无一人，雨水顺着伞骨滴落，敲打着孤独的心。你看着积水中的倒影，那张脸既熟悉又陌生。你问自己：这把伞，究竟是为谁而撑？", "reward": "获得皮肤：[ 雨中行者 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "pei_jue", "name": "配角", "description": "你成全了所有人的圆满，自己却永远是故事里的过客。", "type": "story", "hidden": false, "story": "你成全了所有人的圆满，自己却永远是故事里的过客。\n\n幕布落下，灯光熄灭，无人记得你的名字。主角们在聚光灯下接受鲜花与掌声，而你躲在阴影里，整理好行囊，准备前往下一个片场。", "reward": "获得成就点数：+50", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "wu_sheng", "name": "无声", "description": "你喊过千万次救命，到最后，连回声都冻成了冰。", "type": "story", "hidden": false, "story": "你喊过千万次救命，到最后，连回声都冻成了冰。\n\n寒冷不仅冻结了声音，也冻结了希望。你张开嘴，喉咙里却发不出一丝声响。世界安静得可怕，你只能听见自己心跳的声音，越来越弱，越来越慢……", "reward": "获得特效：[ 寒冰光环 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "ran_jin", "name": "燃烬", "description": "你燃烧自己照亮他人，烧完之后，只剩一地无人问津的灰。", "type": "story", "hidden": false, "story": "你燃烧自己照亮他人，烧完之后，只剩一地无人问津的灰。\n\n火焰熄灭的那一刻，世界重归黑暗。你感到一阵轻松，终于不用再忍受灼烧的痛苦。只是，这灰烬之中，似乎还残留着一点点温度。", "reward": "获得道具：[ 余烬之心 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "huang_ye_gu_xing", "name": "荒野孤行", "description": "一人一刃，踏过无人问津的荒原。", "type": "exploration", "hidden": false, "story": "一人一刃，踏过无人问津的荒原。\n\n孤独是唯一的伴侣，风沙是最好的磨刀石。你不知道走了多久，也不知道要去哪里。你只知道，只要手中的刀还在，你就能一直走下去。", "reward": "获得武器：[ 荒野之刃 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "dai_ma_zhi_shen", "name": "代码之神", "description": "在0与1的洪流中，我即是规则。", "type": "secret", "hidden": true, "story": "在0与1的洪流中，我即是规则。\n\n你看见了世界的源代码。那些所谓的命运、因果、爱恨，不过是一行行冰冷的指令。你伸出手，试图修改其中的一个参数，却发现……", "reward": "获得称号：[ 系统管理员 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "shen_hai_qian_hang", "name": "深海潜航", "description": "在无光的深渊，听见远古的低语。", "type": "exploration", "hidden": true, "story": "在无光的深渊，听见远古的低语。\n\n那不是幻觉，是来自深渊底部的凝视。你感觉到有什么东西正在靠近，巨大的压力挤压着你的潜水艇。你听到了，那是旧日支配者的呼吸声。", "reward": "获得坐骑：[ 深海潜航器 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "xu_kong_di_yu", "name": "虚空低语", "description": "与不可名状之物对话，理智开始消融。", "type": "sanity", "hidden": true, "story": "与不可名状之物对话，理智开始消融。\n\n你触碰到了禁忌的知识。那些不可名状的几何图形在你脑海中旋转，你的认知开始崩塌。你终于明白了，所谓的真理，就是疯狂本身。", "reward": "获得技能：[ 虚空凝视 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "404", "name": "404", "description": "拼尽全力开启的是通往错误的门扉。", "type": "meta", "hidden": true, "story": "拼尽全力开启的是通往错误的门扉。\n\n这里本不该有路。你发现了一个世界的BUG，一个未被开发者填写的空白区域。你站在那里，看着周围虚无的像素，感到一阵莫名的恐惧。", "reward": "获得彩蛋：[ 错误的钥匙 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "ctrl_z", "name": "Ctrl+Z", "description": "这一次，选择归于沉寂。", "type": "meta", "hidden": true, "story": "这一次，选择归于沉寂。\n\n你撤销了所有操作，回到了原点。一切都没有发生过，所有的痛苦、喜悦、遗憾都烟消云散。但这真的是你想要的吗？", "reward": "获得道具：[ 时光沙漏 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "xiao_chou", "name": "小丑", "description": "娱乐众生，愚弄命运。", "type": "role", "hidden": false, "story": "娱乐众生，愚弄命运。\n\n你画上笑脸，掩饰内心的悲伤。你在舞台上翻滚、跳跃、摔倒，引得观众哄堂大笑。他们笑得前仰后合，却没人看见你面具下的泪水。", "reward": "获得皮肤：[ 小丑面具 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "jing_shen_fen_lie", "name": "精神分裂", "description": "就让另一个你来替你分担痛苦。", "type": "personality", "hidden": false, "story": "就让另一个你来替你分担痛苦。\n\n你的脑海中出现了另一个声音，它似乎更强大，更果断。它告诉你：把身体交给我吧，我来帮你承受这一切。你犹豫了，但最终还是点了点头。", "reward": "获得召唤物：[ 第二人格 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "yi_yu", "name": "抑郁", "description": "喧嚣吞没一切，求救无声无力。", "type": "status", "hidden": false, "story": "喧嚣吞没一切，求救无声无力。\n\n你陷入了深深的抑郁，无法自拔。世界变成了灰白色，所有的声音都变得遥远。你躺在床上，看着天花板，感觉身体正在一点点下沉，沉入无底的深渊。", "reward": "获得状态：[ 抑郁 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "ta_ren_ji_di_yu", "name": "他人即地狱", "description": "抱歉，我想活着。……我也是。", "type": "philosophy", "hidden": false, "story": "抱歉，我想活着。……我也是。\n\n他人即是地狱，你无法在这个充满恶意的社会中生存。你试图逃离，却发现无论走到哪里，都充满了审视的目光和恶意的评判。", "reward": "获得技能：[ 孤立 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "shang_di_yi_si", "name": "上帝已死", "description": "神？从未存在。", "type": "philosophy", "hidden": false, "story": "神？从未存在。\n\n你杀死了心中的神，成为了无神论者。你不再相信救赎，不再相信来世。你只相信手中的刀，和眼前的路。", "reward": "获得称号：[ 弑神者 ]", "claimed": false },
            { "id": "xu_wu", "name": "虚无", "description": "通关之后，副本之外空无一人。", "type": "ending", "hidden": false, "story": "通关之后，副本之外空无一人。\n\n你发现世界是虚无的，一切都没有意义。所有的努力、挣扎、爱恨，都只是一串串冰冷的数据。你站在世界的尽头，看着那片虚无，感到前所未有的平静。", "reward": "获得结局：[ 虚无 ]", "claimed": false },
